	["game.skill.arbitersreachwardplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"They designed our salvation. No longer shall",
	["game.skill.arbitersreachwardplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "our people's grief be in vain. From their hands,",
	["game.skill.arbitersreachwardplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "perfection is wrought. Within His reach, we are safe.\"",
	["game.skill.supportahnscitadelplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "As possessed golems ravaged the land, Aul - crowned Ahn",
	["game.skill.supportahnscitadelplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "by blood and tyranny - began the last ritual, causing azurite",
	["game.skill.supportahnscitadelplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "crystals to rupture and grow throughout his doomed citadel.",
	["game.skill.supportailithlineageplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Ailith awoke to find her fire iridescent, and her mind alive",
	["game.skill.supportailithlineageplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "with visions. By morning, she began teaching what she'd",
	["game.skill.supportailithlineageplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "seen... thus was born the Keepers of the Pale Vision.",
	["game.skill.supportamanamustitheplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Those that serve the Liege of the Lightless are his, utterly.",
	["game.skill.supportamanamustitheplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "Blood, flesh, and soul are fodder to bend to his will.",
	["game.skill.supportamanamustitheplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "Under a Lich Lord, not even death is an escape.",
	["game.skill.supportammoconservationplayerfour.flavour_text_1"] = "Confident their enemy was defenseless, the Keitans brazenly",
	["game.skill.supportammoconservationplayerfour.flavour_text_2"] = "charged the walls - but Arjun's ammunition supply reports",
	["game.skill.supportammoconservationplayerfour.flavour_text_3"] = "had been... 'inaccurate'... just like everything else Bardiyan.",
	["game.skill.supportarakaalislustplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "She flashed a smile full of wicked teeth. \"Sin, my darling.",
	["game.skill.supportarakaalislustplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "Forget your Maraketh woes.\" She bit and tore and reveled;",
	["game.skill.supportarakaalislustplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "he lay trapped in silk, wrought with despair and ecstasy.",
	["game.skill.supportarbitersignitionplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"This carving seems to depict curled bodies floating in vats...",
	["game.skill.supportarbitersignitionplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "the next shows all but one of them dying. What were they",
	["game.skill.supportarbitersignitionplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "trying to do? It seems they kept trying... kept experimenting...\"",
	["game.skill.supportataluibloodlettingplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Atazek and Atalui rose, battered and dark, bleeding from a hundred",
	["game.skill.supportataluibloodlettingplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "different wounds. She gave her brother a sinister grin. \"Shall we",
	["game.skill.supportataluibloodlettingplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "show them what happens to those who challenge the Vaal?\"",
	["game.skill.supportatzirisallureplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Such was her seductive power, every noble in the court fell",
	["game.skill.supportatzirisallureplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "over themselves to do her bidding. Winning a single glance",
	["game.skill.supportatzirisallureplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "away from her mirror meant more than their lives.",
	["game.skill.supportatziriscommunionplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The Red Communion was meant to transcend the limits",
	["game.skill.supportatziriscommunionplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "of the soul, to transfigure the flesh, to bestow immortality.",
	["game.skill.supportatziriscommunionplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "It accomplished all of these things... most horribly.",
	["game.skill.supportatzirisimpatienceplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"Those who bored the Queen suffered an excessive punishment:",
	["game.skill.supportatzirisimpatienceplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "everyone they had ever known would be killed, effectively",
	["game.skill.supportatzirisimpatienceplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "erasing their life. So, no matter the cost... none kept her waiting.\"",
	["game.skill.supportbhatairsvengeanceplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "It is said that the Steward of Tales roams Wraeclast still,",
	["game.skill.supportbhatairsvengeanceplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "lost in the form of a Wyvern, full of sorrow and fury at",
	["game.skill.supportbhatairsvengeanceplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "the loss of his beloved pupils to the King in the Mists...",
	["game.skill.supportbreachlordsamalgam.flavour_text_1"] = "The flesh rejoiced. The melding began.",
	["game.skill.supportbreachlordsamalgam.flavour_text_2"] = "Then, fear. Something foreign within.",
	["game.skill.supportbreachlordsamalgam.flavour_text_3"] = "It was cast out too late. The unity was broken.",
	["game.skill.supportbreachlordsrift.flavour_text_1"] = "Our Broken Sun... it is no mere allegory. It is",
	["game.skill.supportbreachlordsrift.flavour_text_2"] = "the consequence of insolent disharmony.",
	["game.skill.supportbreachlordsrift.flavour_text_3"] = "For now, it is contained, but time is against us.",
	["game.skill.supportbrutusbrainplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Shavronne gleefully raised her arms to the sky as lightning",
	["game.skill.supportbrutusbrainplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "flashed. She'd done it! Her creation was perfect! Invincible.",
	["game.skill.supportbrutusbrainplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "Immortal! But she soon realized there was one piece missing...",
	["game.skill.supportcathasbrilliance.flavour_text_1"] = "\"The yellow sap... the Vivid flow... it is the energy of",
	["game.skill.supportcathasbrilliance.flavour_text_2"] = "harmony between disparate forces. They call it the",
	["game.skill.supportcathasbrilliance.flavour_text_3"] = "Catha, an aspect of the Goddess. It is so much more.\"",
	["game.skill.supportcirelscultivationplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The oldest and greatest fortress on Wraeclast was grown, not built.",
	["game.skill.supportcirelscultivationplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "She Who Waited planted their seeds in a time of ash and snow.",
	["game.skill.supportcirelscultivationplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "Now, the gate of the Taisce is unassailable, yet open to all.",
	["game.skill.supportcombatreloadplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"No plan. No stealth. I want shock. Awe. I want them to",
	["game.skill.supportcombatreloadplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "know who did it, and I want them telling tales. That's the",
	["game.skill.supportcombatreloadplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "only way for us to earn their respect... and their fear.\"",
	["game.skill.supportcorruptingcryplayerthree.flavour_text_1"] = "The water used to cool the Locus of Corruption ran red",
	["game.skill.supportcorruptingcryplayerthree.flavour_text_2"] = "as blood, bright as flame, and bubbled with strange heat.",
	["game.skill.supportcorruptingcryplayerthree.flavour_text_3"] = "\"Drink,\" he offered. \"Suffuse your flesh with power!\"",
	["game.skill.supportdaressospassionplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"I raised my eyes to look upon my death. Instead, I saw her.",
	["game.skill.supportdaressospassionplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "Merveil. Fighting had always been about survival. Now the",
	["game.skill.supportdaressospassionplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "fight became about something much greater... love.\"",
	["game.skill.supportdiallasdesireplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"I will become your Gemling Queen, my love, but not",
	["game.skill.supportdiallasdesireplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "with such dull stones. I want to give myself to you",
	["game.skill.supportdiallasdesireplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "for eternity. Surely we can seek perfection together?\"",
	["game.skill.supportdoedresundoingplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Doedre's depravity knew no limits. She stretched and",
	["game.skill.supportdoedresundoingplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "broke and rebuilt herself until she forgot her own shape.",
	["game.skill.supportdoedresundoingplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "She reverted to a familiar form, and began anew.",
	["game.skill.supporteinharsbeastriteplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"You must cut the beast, like this,\" he told the wide-eyed",
	["game.skill.supporteinharsbeastriteplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "and forgetful woman. \"The juiciest parts are in the middle!\"",
	["game.skill.supporteinharsbeastriteplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "She nodded, and began relearning the way of the wilds.",
	["game.skill.supporteonyrsthunderplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"How? Well, the Great Wyvern granted her passage, of course.",
	["game.skill.supporteonyrsthunderplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "Eonyr and his flock soar the winds between us and the Moon.",
	["game.skill.supporteonyrsthunderplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "The roar of the storm... that's them, as they hunt and call.\"",
	["game.skill.supporteshsprowess.flavour_text_1"] = "Knowledge unending had transcended physical form.",
	["game.skill.supporteshsprowess.flavour_text_2"] = "Her minds raced through metal latticework as the",
	["game.skill.supporteshsprowess.flavour_text_3"] = "flesh of the melding reached up to contain her.",
	["game.skill.supporteshsradianceplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"Where life once thrived, now only metal grows, inching",
	["game.skill.supporteshsradianceplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "like endless worms through the ash. Where silence fell,",
	["game.skill.supporteshsradianceplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "now sourceless thought whispers numbers in the dark.\"",
	["game.skill.supportflukeplayertwo.flavour_text_1"] = "Few mortals can comprehend the horror of experiencing",
	["game.skill.supportflukeplayertwo.flavour_text_2"] = "every possibility. Chaos alone takes joy in the",
	["game.skill.supportflukeplayertwo.flavour_text_3"] = "unthinkable and the unimaginable made manifest.",
	["game.skill.supportgarukhansresolveplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "At the last, her hope gone - but not her resolve - she threw her",
	["game.skill.supportgarukhansresolveplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "beloved Tangletongue. That was the day a god bled. For this, the",
	["game.skill.supportgarukhansresolveplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "Great Roc graced a Maraketh warrior with a feather for the first time.",
	["game.skill.supportguatelitzisablationplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Young Guatelitzi was found moving among the prisoners,",
	["game.skill.supportguatelitzisablationplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "preparing their living bodies for sacrifice. The High Priests",
	["game.skill.supportguatelitzisablationplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "recognised his inclinations, and gave him a higher calling.",
	["game.skill.supporthardytotemsplayerthree.flavour_text_1"] = "A scavenging warrior found Tawhoa meditating in a grove.",
	["game.skill.supporthardytotemsplayerthree.flavour_text_2"] = "\"There is only so much jade in this world,\" intoned the god.",
	["game.skill.supporthardytotemsplayerthree.flavour_text_3"] = "\"Take my gift to your tribe. Ironwood will grow for all time.\"",
	["game.skill.supporthayoxisbindingplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The Architect of Destruction slipped explosive powder",
	["game.skill.supporthayoxisbindingplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "under the royal temple one pinch at a time. For years,",
	["game.skill.supporthayoxisbindingplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "he clung to that, never finding the courage to light it.",
	["game.skill.supporthelbrymshideplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Surrounded by abominations, Lysanda of Myr expected her",
	["game.skill.supporthelbrymshideplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "time had come to an end. Helbrym of Tarth charged from",
	["game.skill.supporthelbrymshideplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "the trees, breaking his oath, to save the Ezomyte Queen.",
	["game.skill.supportherdeclarationplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"The laws are binding. They are absolute. If they believe",
	["game.skill.supportherdeclarationplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "it is their choice to enforce them, all the better.",
	["game.skill.supportherdeclarationplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "Upholding our solemn duty is imperative.\"",
	["game.skill.supportkalisascrescendoplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"Her voice reached into my chest and plucked my beating",
	["game.skill.supportkalisascrescendoplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "heart from its cage. By the wide, glistening eyes of my",
	["game.skill.supportkalisascrescendoplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "fellow punters, I knew that they felt it, too.\"",
	["game.skill.supportkaomsmadnessplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "As King Kaom delved further into Wraeclast, so, too, did he",
	["game.skill.supportkaomsmadnessplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "draw closer to the Beast. One night, in a nightmarish fit, he",
	["game.skill.supportkaomsmadnessplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "swung his axe at his own men, slaughtering hundreds.",
	["game.skill.supportkhatalsrejuvenationplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The surging geysers flooded the tunnels of the ancient",
	["game.skill.supportkhatalsrejuvenationplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "enemy, destroying whole legions. His akhara turned to",
	["game.skill.supportkhatalsrejuvenationplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "praise the tale-man Khatal, but he was dust on the wind.",
	["game.skill.supportkulemaksdominionplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Still a shadow of his former self, Kulemak turned to deception.",
	["game.skill.supportkulemaksdominionplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "He promised Ahn untold power and mastery, in exchange for",
	["game.skill.supportkulemaksdominionplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "a single golem. \"After all, what harm could one servant do?\"",
	["game.skill.supportkurgalsleashplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Kurgal's first body was a mere stone golem, enslaved by a",
	["game.skill.supportkurgalsleashplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "collar. He found such ecstasy in the power of dominion,",
	["game.skill.supportkurgalsleashplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "he clawed his way free... and soon, supplanted a Lich Lord.",
	["game.skill.supportmedvedsfelling.flavour_text_1"] = "\"There is no zealotry like that of a mystic roused",
	["game.skill.supportmedvedsfelling.flavour_text_2"] = "to battle. He broke his own code, wielding weapons",
	["game.skill.supportmedvedsfelling.flavour_text_3"] = "long forbidden, to defend that which he loved.\"",
	["game.skill.supportmorganastempestplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "On the nights the fugue would come over her, the Ezomytes would",
	["game.skill.supportmorganastempestplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "gather below, begging her to bring the rains. Atop the Taisce,",
	["game.skill.supportmorganastempestplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "wailing with unknown sorrows, her cries made the skies rage.",
	["game.skill.supportmorrigansinsight.flavour_text_1"] = "\"Wild energy is as misunderstood as the Mórrigan",
	["game.skill.supportmorrigansinsight.flavour_text_2"] = "itself. Many revere life, yet revile death. What is dead",
	["game.skill.supportmorrigansinsight.flavour_text_3"] = "feeds the living. Death is but one aspect of the whole.\"",
	["game.skill.supportoisinsoathplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The first Warden of Eaves swore to patrol the border twixt the worlds forevermore, so that the tragedy of Gruthkul's stampede would never recur. In time, his vigil on the edge began to... change him.",
	["game.skill.supportolrothsconvictionplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The Empty-Eyed Fiend emerged from darkness.",
	["game.skill.supportolrothsconvictionplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "Olroth raised his sword, gem in its pommel.",
	["game.skill.supportolrothsconvictionplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "The Fiend smiled. Olroth swung.",
	["game.skill.supportolrothsconvictionplayer.flavour_text_4"] = "Its head rolled, sockets ablaze with delight.",
	["game.skill.supportolrothshubrisplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The gem warmed his palm. \"Our fear of this",
	["game.skill.supportolrothshubrisplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "power cost many lives. No longer!\" With his own",
	["game.skill.supportolrothshubrisplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "hands, Olroth sealed that expedition's demise.",
	["game.skill.supportpietysmercyplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The High Templar needed thousands of prisoners if his and",
	["game.skill.supportpietysmercyplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "Piety's experiments were to succeed. Conspiring on the",
	["game.skill.supportpietysmercyplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "matter, they decided to revive an age old tradition... exile.",
	["game.skill.supportprototypeseventeenplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"The murals tell a story of creation, of design... the Precursors",
	["game.skill.supportprototypeseventeenplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "delved into the secrets of life itself. In their war with the Abyssals,",
	["game.skill.supportprototypeseventeenplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "they sought to breed warriors, grown in legions, to fight back...\"",
	["game.skill.supportrakiatasflowplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The Tasalio Tribe developed their own Way, seeing",
	["game.skill.supportrakiatasflowplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "the world not as it is, but as it should be, given its",
	["game.skill.supportrakiatasflowplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "roiling and endless grace of constant motion.",
	["game.skill.supportrigwaldsferocityplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"Skothe kept us idle, sitting safe on these islands, while our",
	["game.skill.supportrigwaldsferocityplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "brethren remain slaves. We are one and the same! We must",
	["game.skill.supportrigwaldsferocityplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "fight! So, I bring you his head. I am now your Wolven King!\"",
	["game.skill.supportromirasrequitalplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"Come, my faithful wife,\" he crooned. \"Sit. Eat. I wanted to",
	["game.skill.supportromirasrequitalplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "reward you for your loyalty. I even cooked this myself...\"",
	["game.skill.supportromirasrequitalplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "She looked 'round for her sons, but hers was the only chair.",
	["game.skill.supportseraphsheartplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Intricate machinery imperceptibly woven into a",
	["game.skill.supportseraphsheartplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "biological foundation. It felt delicate in her hands.",
	["game.skill.supportseraphsheartplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "In him, it would be her greatest achievement.",
	["game.skill.supportstyrnsferocity.flavour_text_1"] = "Each knight who encountered Styrn challenged",
	["game.skill.supportstyrnsferocity.flavour_text_2"] = "him to the traditional duel. One by one, he fought",
	["game.skill.supportstyrnsferocity.flavour_text_3"] = "his way across all of Middengard... and beyond.",
	["game.skill.supportstyrnsmountain.flavour_text_1"] = "Bound by his oath to the Runefathers, Styrn the",
	["game.skill.supportstyrnsmountain.flavour_text_2"] = "Indomitable refused to bow to Cadigan the First.",
	["game.skill.supportstyrnsmountain.flavour_text_3"] = "His resistance laid the seeds for future defiance.",
	["game.skill.supporttacatisireplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "He almost saved the Vaal. His unique poison made it past",
	["game.skill.supporttacatisireplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "the Queen's cupbearers; he had only to direct his anger...",
	["game.skill.supporttacatisireplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "but in her presence, he could feel naught but lust.",
	["game.skill.supporttangmazusthuribleplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "In his roiling fog, their fear becomes form.",
	["game.skill.supporttangmazusthuribleplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "Dark truths unveiled by a shroud. They see only",
	["game.skill.supporttangmazusthuribleplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "their perception of him, and thus, he is remade.",
	["game.skill.supporttasaliosrhythmplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The Chieftain built a grand waikoama, and boasted that",
	["game.skill.supporttasaliosrhythmplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "it could never be sunk. Tasalio grinned, and the waves",
	["game.skill.supporttasaliosrhythmplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "rolled in, tilting the ship, cresting higher and higher...",
	["game.skill.supporttecrodsrevengeplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The Lich Lords destroyed his body, but with his dying fury,",
	["game.skill.supporttecrodsrevengeplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "Tecrod found a way. He lurks deep, in the blood, in the flesh,",
	["game.skill.supporttecrodsrevengeplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "in the Well... perhaps walking among them even now, unseen.",
	["game.skill.supporttrickstersshardplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "They'd cast him out, declared him a dark omen. Their judgement",
	["game.skill.supporttrickstersshardplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "rattled in his head. He'd no control over crops, or herds, but",
	["game.skill.supporttrickstersshardplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "that mattered little. Upon his return, their fear was his weapon.",
	["game.skill.supporttulsavalanche.flavour_text_1"] = "Then, there was movement. What once preserved them",
	["game.skill.supporttulsavalanche.flavour_text_2"] = "now pulled them free from their silence. In the",
	["game.skill.supporttulsavalanche.flavour_text_3"] = "absence of stillness, their screams echoed.",
	["game.skill.supporttulsstillnessplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"Countless graves glow silently in endless rows that stretch",
	["game.skill.supporttulsstillnessplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "on unseen. The living lie within, but do not decay, do not",
	["game.skill.supporttulsstillnessplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "die. Their eyes remain open, their essence stilled, waiting.\"",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredauguryplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Studying the ill omens of the stars, Uhtred came to suspect",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredauguryplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "something was very wrong among the first Kalguurans.",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredauguryplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "Olroth, Vorana, Medved... three there were. Three dangers.",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredexodusplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "By the time Uhtred realised the truth, only Vorana remained",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredexodusplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "to defend them. While the rest fled, she implanted her flesh",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredexodusplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "with gems and set forth alone to face the endless hordes.",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredomenplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Day and night, his priests followed each of the Kalguuran",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredomenplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "heroes. When Medved disappeared, Uhtred grew even more",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredomenplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "paranoid. Now, only two remained... Olroth and Vorana.",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredsconstellation.flavour_text_1"] = "\"In the stars, I see our future. My plans are laid,",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredsconstellation.flavour_text_2"] = "lines tracing a constellation. You may only see",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredsconstellation.flavour_text_3"] = "pieces, but I see the whole, and it will be glorious.\"",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredsriteplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"To control the stars, we swallow the firmament.",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredsriteplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "We imbibe the truth. We are filled with the void.",
	["game.skill.supportuhtredsriteplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "We embrace the vast emptiness, or we die.\"",
	["game.skill.supporturukssmeltingplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "The volcano roared, but there was no thunder, only the boom",
	["game.skill.supporturukssmeltingplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "of Uruk's hammer. Wraeclast had forgotten the old alliance,",
	["game.skill.supporturukssmeltingplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "but by the Molten One's will, the fires would rage again.",
	["game.skill.supportuulnetolsembraceplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"The Lords could not breathe, so they grew new lungs.",
	["game.skill.supportuulnetolsembraceplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "The Lords could not venture, so they grew new skin.",
	["game.skill.supportuulnetolsembraceplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "The Lords were alone, so they grew us, to serve them.\"",
	["game.skill.supportvarashtasblessingplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"These traditions we shall set forth, so that we may remain",
	["game.skill.supportvarashtasblessingplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "strong, so that we may endure throughout the ages. Not to",
	["game.skill.supportvarashtasblessingplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "bind, not to dominate, but to protect... and guide.\"",
	["game.skill.supportvilentaspropulsionplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Day and night, she hammered away, obsessed with proving it",
	["game.skill.supportvilentaspropulsionplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "could be done; a vast ring of artifice under the earth, pushing",
	["game.skill.supportvilentaspropulsionplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "energy to speeds never before seen - all to prove Qotra wrong.",
	["game.skill.supportvoranassiege.flavour_text_1"] = "\"Your laws of war are asinine. I shall prevail!",
	["game.skill.supportvoranassiege.flavour_text_2"] = "I'll crush every pawn you put before me.",
	["game.skill.supportvoranassiege.flavour_text_3"] = "Face me, coward! Play by my rules.\"",
	["game.skill.supportvruunsaftermath.flavour_text_1"] = "Vruun tore through Tul's preserved, shattering their",
	["game.skill.supportvruunsaftermath.flavour_text_2"] = "bodies with reckless malice. \"The will of the Lords!\"",
	["game.skill.supportvruunsaftermath.flavour_text_3"] = "he roared over his decimation. \"All broods must serve.\"",
	["game.skill.supportvruunsinevitability.flavour_text_1"] = "\"If you think you've won, it's only because you don't",
	["game.skill.supportvruunsinevitability.flavour_text_2"] = "understand their strategy. Each Vruun you kill only",
	["game.skill.supportvruunsinevitability.flavour_text_3"] = "teaches the next one how to endure against you.\"",
	["game.skill.supportwildshardsplayerthree.flavour_text_1"] = "She holds in her hand a shattered crystal, a vision of her desire: to",
	["game.skill.supportwildshardsplayerthree.flavour_text_2"] = "see her sister's silver palace obliterated, to see it cast across the",
	["game.skill.supportwildshardsplayerthree.flavour_text_3"] = "heavens. One cross word, and the sky will rain down her fury.",
	["game.skill.supportxibaquasrendingplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Born of the gods, his treachery was met with divine fury.",
	["game.skill.supportxibaquasrendingplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "One by one, the gods reclaimed their flesh, until all that",
	["game.skill.supportxibaquasrendingplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "remained was a droplet of pure light: the first Vaal.",
	["game.skill.supportxophspyreplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"They drank until only dust remained. Ate until their gums",
	["game.skill.supportxophspyreplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "bled rust. Such was their greed, the only thing that remains",
	["game.skill.supportxophspyreplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "of the Broken Sun... is the Red Pyre, the Torus Eternal.\"",
	["game.skill.supportzarokhsrefrainplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Reliving the same day for all time, Zarokh raged against",
	["game.skill.supportzarokhsrefrainplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "the moments that made up his prison. There would be",
	["game.skill.supportzarokhsrefrainplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "no redemption, for he had broken his only barya.",
	["game.skill.supportzarokhsrevoltplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "Zarokh's ire built over the centuries as he planned his escape.",
	["game.skill.supportzarokhsrevoltplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "The Afarud would find what he sought, and then... the",
	["game.skill.supportzarokhsrevoltplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "Weeping Black would break the chains of his prison.",
	["game.skill.supportzerphislegacyplayer.flavour_text_1"] = "\"It was the quality of his heinous acts that set him apart, not",
	["game.skill.supportzerphislegacyplayer.flavour_text_2"] = "the quantity... all of the physical trauma inflicted occurred",
	["game.skill.supportzerphislegacyplayer.flavour_text_3"] = "while the victim was still alive. Perhaps this was the key.\"",
